the-chancellor (Vizier) includes code adapted from civ6-mcp:
  https://github.com/lmwilki/civ6-mcp
  - src/chancellor/tuner.py: FireTuner wire protocol and connection handling
    (from src/civ_mcp/tuner_client.py and connection.py)
  - src/chancellor/sources/lua_queries.py: the identity, empire overview,
    policies and production queries (from src/civ_mcp/lua/*.py)

